msgstr "Enlace de conexión"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:386
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:413
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:419
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:589
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:596
msgid "Copy connector URL"
msgstr "Copiar URL del conector"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:392
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:436
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:608
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:996
msgid "Approve access"
msgstr "Apruebe el acceso"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:401
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:405
msgid "Open ChatGPT"
msgstr "Abrir ChatGPT"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:407
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:558
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:577
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:698
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1713
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(se abre en una pestaña nueva)"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:409
msgid "Connection link copied — paste it into ChatGPT as the MCP server URL."
msgstr ""
"Enlace de conexión copiado — péguelo en ChatGPT como URL del servidor MCP."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:410
msgid "Copies your connection link and opens ChatGPT in a new tab."
msgstr "Copia su enlace de conexión y abre ChatGPT en una pestaña nueva."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:412
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:588
msgid "Copy the link yourself"
msgstr "Copiar el enlace manualmente"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:417
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:594
msgid "Copy your connection link"
msgstr "Copie su enlace de conexión"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:426
msgid ""
"Go to <code>chatgpt.com</code> and sign in (MCP apps work on the web only)."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a <code>chatgpt.com</code> e inicie sesión (las apps MCP solo funcionan "
"en la web)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:427
msgid ""
"Under <code>Settings → Security and login</code>, turn on <strong>Developer "
"mode</strong> (once)."
msgstr ""
"En <code>Configuración → Seguridad e inicio de sesión</code>, active el "
"<strong>Modo desarrollador</strong> (una sola vez)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:428
msgid ""
"Go to <code>Plugins</code>, click <strong>+</strong> and choose <strong>Add "
"custom MCP server</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a <code>Plugins</code>, haga clic en <strong>+</strong> y elija "
"<strong>Añadir servidor MCP personalizado</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:429
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link as the <strong>MCP server URL</strong>, set "
"Authentication to <strong>OAuth</strong> and create it."
msgstr ""
"Póngale un nombre, pegue el enlace como <strong>URL del servidor MCP</"
"strong>, establezca la autenticación en <strong>OAuth</strong> y créelo."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:440
msgid "Which ChatGPT plans work?"
msgstr "¿Qué planes de ChatGPT funcionan?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:441
msgid ""
"Requires a ChatGPT <strong>Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise or Edu</strong> "
"plan, on the web. On Business and Enterprise workspaces an admin has to "
"allow Developer mode first."
msgstr ""
"Requiere un plan de ChatGPT <strong>Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise o Edu</"
"strong>, en la web. En los espacios de trabajo Business y Enterprise, un "
"administrador debe permitir antes Developer mode."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:460
msgid "Go to <code>perplexity.ai</code> in your browser and sign in."
msgstr "Ve a <code>perplexity.ai</code> en tu navegador e inicia sesión."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:461
msgid ""
"Open <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong>, click <strong>+ Custom "
"connector</strong> and choose <strong>Add MCP connector</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Abre <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong>, haz clic en <strong>+ Custom "
"connector</strong> y elige <strong>Add MCP connector</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:462
msgid ""
"Give it a name, paste the link from step 1 as the <strong>MCP server URL</"
"strong> (Advanced already says OAuth and Streamable HTTP), tick the "
"acknowledgement and click <strong>Add</strong>. Open the new connector and "
"click <strong>Add connector</strong> — Perplexity opens the sign-in in a "
"popup."
msgstr ""
"Ponle un nombre, pega el enlace del paso 1 como <strong>MCP server URL</"
"strong> (en Advanced ya figuran OAuth y Streamable HTTP), marca la casilla "
"de confirmación y haz clic en <strong>Add</strong>. Abre el nuevo conector y "
"haz clic en <strong>Add connector</strong>: Perplexity abre el inicio de "
"sesión en una ventana emergente."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:464
msgid ""
"<strong>Needs Perplexity Pro, Max or Enterprise.</strong> The free plan has "
"no custom connectors."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Requiere Perplexity Pro, Max o Enterprise.</strong> El plan gratuito "
"no tiene conectores personalizados."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:465
msgid ""
"Verified on Pro (2026-10-12). On Enterprise, an admin has to allow member "
"custom connectors first."
msgstr ""
"Comprobado con Pro (2026-10-12). En Enterprise, un administrador debe "
"permitir antes los conectores personalizados de los miembros."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:466
msgid ""
"Back in Perplexity, the connector shows a check mark. Ask a question that "
"names it; Perplexity asks you to reply <code>yes</code> before its first "
"tool run."
msgstr ""
"De vuelta en Perplexity, el conector muestra una marca de verificación. Haz "
"una pregunta que lo nombre; Perplexity te pide responder <code>yes</code> "
"antes de su primera ejecución de herramienta."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:470
msgid "Go to <code>grok.com/connectors</code> and sign in."
msgstr "Ve a <code>grok.com/connectors</code> e inicia sesión."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:471
msgid ""
"Click <strong>New Connector</strong>, choose <strong>Custom</strong>, give "
"it a name and paste the link from step 1 as the <strong>Server URL</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en <strong>New Connector</strong>, elige <strong>Custom</strong>, "
"ponle un nombre y pega el enlace del paso 1 como <strong>Server URL</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:472
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Add Connector</strong> — Grok opens the sign-in in a popup."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en <strong>Add Connector</strong>: Grok abre el inicio de sesión en "
"una ventana emergente."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:474
msgid ""
"Works on the free plan (verified 2026-10-12) as well as SuperGrok and X "
"Premium+. On Business and Enterprise workspaces an admin provisions the "
"connector first."
msgstr ""
"Funciona en el plan gratuito (comprobado el 2026-10-12) y también con "
"SuperGrok y X Premium+. En los espacios de trabajo Business y Enterprise, un "
"administrador aprovisiona primero el conector."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:475
msgid ""
"Back in Grok, the connector shows as <strong>Added</strong>. In a chat, type "
"<code>@</code> to pick it."
msgstr ""
"De vuelta en Grok, el conector aparece como <strong>Added</strong>. En un "
"chat, escribe <code>@</code> para elegirlo."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:479
msgid ""
"Sign in to Gemini with a <strong>personal</strong> Google account — work and "
"school accounts do not get Custom apps."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión en Gemini con una cuenta de Google <strong>personal</strong>: "
"las cuentas de trabajo y de centros educativos no tienen Custom apps."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:480
msgid ""
"Under <strong>Settings → Connected Apps → Custom apps</strong>, paste the "
"link from step 1 into <strong>Add a custom app link</strong> and click "
"<strong>Next</strong> twice."
msgstr ""
"En <strong>Settings → Connected Apps → Custom apps</strong>, pega el enlace "
"del paso 1 en <strong>Add a custom app link</strong> y haz clic en "
"<strong>Next</strong> dos veces."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:481
msgid ""
"Tick the acknowledgement, click <strong>Connect</strong>, then <strong>Agree "
"and continue</strong> — Gemini opens the sign-in page."
msgstr ""
"Marca la casilla de confirmación, haz clic en <strong>Connect</strong> y "
"luego en <strong>Agree and continue</strong>: Gemini abre la página de "
"inicio de sesión."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:483
msgid ""
"Google lists no plan requirement (verified on a Google AI Plus account). You "
"need a personal Google account in the United States, 18 or over, with Gemini "
"in English and Keep Activity on; work and school accounts do not get Custom "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Google no indica ningún requisito de plan (verificado con una cuenta Google "
"AI Plus). Necesitas una cuenta de Google personal en Estados Unidos, tener "
"18 años o más, Gemini en inglés y Keep Activity activado; las cuentas de "
"trabajo y de centros educativos no tienen Custom apps."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:484
msgid ""
"Back in Gemini, click <strong>Connect</strong> on the “Save your custom app” "
"card. In a chat, type <code>@</code> to pick the app; Gemini asks you to "
"allow its first tool run."
msgstr ""
"De vuelta en Gemini, haz clic en <strong>Connect</strong> en la tarjeta "
"«Save your custom app». En un chat, escribe <code>@</code> para elegir la "
"app; Gemini te pedirá permiso la primera vez que ejecute una herramienta."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:491
msgid ""
"Paste the message into a new chat on <code>muse.ai</code> (or in the Muse "
"app) and send it. If Muse asks to contact your site, allow it."
msgstr ""
"Pega el mensaje en un chat nuevo en <code>muse.ai</code> (o en la app de "
"Muse) y envíalo. Si Muse pide permiso para contactar con tu sitio, "
"permíteselo."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:492
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Connect</strong> on the connector card, then <strong>Connect</"
"strong> again in the dialog — Muse opens the sign-in page in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en <strong>Connect</strong> en la tarjeta del conector y de nuevo "
"en <strong>Connect</strong> en el diálogo: Muse abre la página de inicio de "
"sesión en una pestaña nueva."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:499
msgid ""
"Meta offers Muse to adults in the United States. Meta does not review custom "
"connectors, so add only sites you manage."
msgstr ""
"Meta ofrece Muse a adultos en Estados Unidos. Meta no revisa los conectores "
"personalizados, así que añade solo sitios que gestiones tú."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:500
msgid ""
"Muse asks you to approve each request it sends to your site (<strong>Allow "
"once</strong> or <strong>Always allow this site</strong>)."
msgstr ""
"Muse te pide aprobar cada solicitud que envía a tu sitio (<strong>Allow "
"once</strong> o <strong>Always allow this site</strong>)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:502
msgid ""
"This site is behind Cloudflare: its Browser Integrity Check blocks Muse with "
"error 1010. Turn it off for <code>/wp-json/cowboy-mcp/</code>."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio está detrás de Cloudflare: su Browser Integrity Check bloquea a "
"Muse con el error 1010. Desactívalo para <code>/wp-json/cowboy-mcp/</code>."

