#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:674
msgid ""
"Click <strong>+ Add</strong>, then <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en <strong>+ Add</strong> y, a continuación, en <strong>Add custom "
